       "source": "HAMAP-Rule",
       "id": "MF_03039"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Component of the cytosolic iron-sulfur (Fe/S) protein assembly (CIA) machinery. Required for maturation of extramitochondrial Fe-S proteins. The NUBP1-NUBP2 heterotetramer forms a Fe-S scaffold complex, mediating the de novo assembly of an Fe-S cluster and its transfer to target apoproteins. Negatively regulates cilium formation and structure"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "FUNCTION"
  },
  {
   "commentType": "COFACTOR",
   "cofactors": [
    {
     "name": "[4Fe-4S] cluster",
